<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 42-day T-bills sell at average 11.792 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 42-day T-bills sell at average 11.792 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian treasury bill sales at weekly auction on Friday as announced by the Central Bank on Monday:</p>
<p>    AUCTION DATE			13 June	6 June</p>
<p>    TENOR				 42 days	42 days</p>
<p>    AMOUNT SOLD (million naira)   875	    625</p>
<p>    BIDS (million naira)	    875	    625</p>
<p>    WEIGHTED AVERAGE RATE	   11.7923	11.7740 pct</p>
<p>    TRUE YIELD			  11.9627	11.9627 pct</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
